00a71\u20139, and \u00a710 through Lemma 10.8.2 with proof, environment 10.8.3, Definition 10.8.4, and the attached restriction, topological inverse-limit and additive covariant completion-functor paragraphs immediately before Proposition 10.8.5. It does not claim that the full EGA corpus is complete.</p><p>This Korean edition remains in one Zenodo language lineage and is mirrored as the identical four-file release in the continuing Figshare article at https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.33314679. It is a translation of and part of the stable global/source EGA object at https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20414353. The reinstated public repository is https://github.com/KokunoYumeto/ega-ko. Editable TeX, exact source identities, decisions, corrections, build evidence, extraction checks, visual QA and SHA-256 manifests are included. Production contribution: <em>AI typesetting & translation</em>.</p><p>CC BY 4.0 applies only, to the extent rights are held, to the Korean translation, Korean typesetting, and project-authored metadata, indexes, decisions and QA evidence. The underlying mathematical work, historical French edition and third-party bibliographic material retain their own rights and attribution. The historical authors, NUMDAM and original publisher do not endorse this independently maintained translation; no human external certification or critical-edition status is claimed.</p>", "funding": null, "funding_list": [], "version": 4, "status": "public", "size": 33884387, "created_date": "2026-08-22T22:28:05Z", "modified_date": "2026-08-22T22:28:05Z", "is_public": true, "is_confidential": false, "is_metadata_record": false, "confidential_reason": "", "metadata_reason": "", "license": {"value": 1, "name": "CC BY 4.0", "url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, "tags": ["\u00c9l\u00e9ments de g\u00e9om\u00e9trie alg\u00e9brique", "EGA", "algebraic geometry", "\ub300\uc218\uae30\ud558\ud559", "\ud55c\uad6d\uc5b4", "Korean translation", "Grothendieck", "Dieud